OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 25 NOV
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Max Roach
OL,5,     GKate Molleson is joined by Kevin
OL,6,     GLeGendre to explore the life and
OL,7,     Gwork of drummer and composer Max
OL,8,     GRoach. Today focusing on his
OL,9,     Gcollaboration with Clifford Brown.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GLive music and interviews from
OL,12,     Gthe world's finest classical
OL,13,     Gmusicians.
OL,14,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,15,     GUplifting choral music opens and
OL,16,     Gcloses this evocative Classical
OL,17,     GMixtape from BBC Radio 3.
